WEBVTT

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.453
has been an extraordinary privilege,

00:20:01.477 --> 00:20:03.071
and I feel really blessed

00:20:03.095 --> 00:20:05.515
to have been here today
to communicate that to you.

00:20:05.539 --> 00:20:06.704
Thank you very much.

00:20:06.728 --> 00:20:08.904
(Applause)